1. WHAT THIS IS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Tyr is a single static binary for Linux servers that inventories the
hardware, checks its health, stresses it and judges whether a machine is
fit for production; it reports to the terminal, Markdown, NetBox and
webhooks, and comes with a live ISO for acceptance tests. It is an
independent project.

